          objective: 'Empty your hand before the other players by following suit when possible and avoiding situations where you must pick up the current trick.',
          gameplay: 'Players lead to tricks and must follow suit if able. The highest card of the led suit wins the trick and discards it. A player unable to follow suit must pick up all cards already played to the current trick, then leads the next trick.',
          keyRules: [
            'There are no trumps.',
            'Following suit is mandatory when possible.',
            'Failure to follow suit forces the player to pick up the whole current trick.',
          ],
